  <translations>
    <en>
      <description>Rain Bird LFV-075 is a solenoid valve designed specifically for drip irrigation and low flow rates. Its specialised diaphragm supports reliable operation at low flow and helps prevent valve weeping. External manual bleed makes flushing during installation and servicing easier. Series specifications: 3/4″ connection; approximate flow range 0.6–37.8 l/min; pressure 1.0–10.3 bar; 24 VAC, 50/60 Hz solenoid.</description>
